                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG ZUM TRAGEN VON KINDERN UND JUGENDLICHEN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE SUPPORT D'ENFANT ET ENSEMBLE DE SUPPORT JUVÉNILE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CHILD SUPPORT APPARATUS AND JUVENILE SUPPORT ASSEMBLY</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A child support apparatus (100, 200, 300, 400, 500, 600, 700) includes a standing frame (102, 202, 302, 402, 502, 602, 702), and a juvenile support assembly (106, 206, 306, 406, 506, 606, 706) supported on the standing frame (102, 202, 302, 402, 502, 602, 702) and having a left side and a right side and a front end and a rear end, wherein the juvenile support assembly (106, 206, 306, 406, 506, 606, 706) includes a resilient wire (158) forming a bearing support for a child that is elastically deformable along an upward-downward direction of the juvenile support assembly (106, 206, 306, 406, 506, 606, 706), the resilient wire (158) extending between the left and right sides and having two opposite ends (162) respectively anchored at the left and right sides of the juvenile support assembly (106), the resilient wire (158) being bent to form a wave shape (170) that stretches back and forth between the front end and the rear end of the juvenile support assembly (106, 206, 306, 406, 506, 606, 706).</p>
            </abstract>
